{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギガ200のデビューライブの日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい事を聞かされましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/24/3002615/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キンタロー。さんが細かすぎて伝わらないモノマネに生駒ちゃんのモノマネで出ますとヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、このツーショット載せるの今日まで我慢していました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/24/3002615/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど家族が遊びに来てて、みんなで見たんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃ似てた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、こんな感じだな〜って！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族で大爆笑ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にキンタロー。さんモノマネして下さってありがとうございますヽ(・∀・)ノ⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのカツラわざわざ新宿の店に行って買ったんですって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服も用意して下さって(´；ω；｀)⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白い時間をありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売のB.L.T.さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女優の森川葵さんと対談記事が載っています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の大好きな女の子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔小さくて可愛くて考え方もよくてドキドキしっぱなしでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/24/3002615/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悶える。ほどの可愛さ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にスタッフさんありがとうございます(´；ω；｀)(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも是非見てくださいねヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/24/3002615/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女優さんてほんとに綺麗"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/24/3002615/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}